    // presence (vehicle-01/executor): §11.1 Consume and Call (0.8, 0.14), §8.1, §3.3: liveliness reads and the descriptor's GET and subscription on the `@zk` subtree of each service named. A refused read is answered complete and empty, so a reader the grants refuse would attribute silence to absence (§11.3)
    { id: "presence-in:vehicle-01/executor", permission: "allow", flows: ["ingress"],
