      key_exprs: ["zk2/ground/fleet-mgr/@zk/**"] },
    // own (vehicle-01/archive): §11.1 Own: the service puts, deletes, serves and declares tokens under its prefix, each verbatim subtree spelled out because `**` never crosses one (§1.3), its `@adv` subtrees where it uses advanced publication (§2.5); reply covers its answers to queries on its own keys
    { id: "own-in:vehicle-01/archive", permission: "allow", flows: ["ingress"],
